OL,3,GNEWSAArtists hiding painted pebbles
OL,4,Aaround the world
OL,5,
OL,6,FA craft group has hit 8,000 members six
OL,7,Fyears after they began hiding painted
OL,8,Fpebbles around the world.
OL,10,FStephanie Winter and her aunt Victoria
OL,11,FMorris set up Consett Rocks in 2020 to
OL,12,Fhelp people stay creative during the
OL,13,Fcoronavirus pandemic.
OL,15,FSince then, Winter has painted hundreds
OL,16,Fof stones and the group has amassed
OL,17,Fthousands of members on social media,
OL,18,Fall posting painted pebbles they have
OL,19,Fhidden or found.
